; Botched! map resource
; id: trapworks-01
; name: Trap Works
; description: G2-A playtest: one proximity trap (X1) in the middle, armed from the two K1 consoles on the side walls.
; players: 2-4
;
; The trap hits every robot on the eight tiles around X1 (columns 4-6, rows 3-5) once, then disarms.
; Dispenser G1 sits inside that area, so grabbing its crate while the trap is armed is a gamble. A robot
; standing next to a K1 console that executes TOGGLE (T) arms the trap and becomes its owner: damage it
; deals to opponents scores for the owner (+1 per hit, +3 more for a disable). Neutral and self-inflicted
; damage scores nothing.
